This project is inspired by the architectural idea described in public
articles about Kloak (placeholder secrets rewritten in-kernel via eBPF).
It is an independent implementation under the MIT license and does not
contain code derived from spinningfactory/kloak (AGPL-3.0).

The npm client API is intentionally compatible with node-vault
(https://github.com/nodevault/node-vault), which is MIT-licensed.
Compatibility does not imply affiliation with HashiCorp or the node-vault
maintainers.
